    "dialogue_segments": [
      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-1",
        "beat_id": "beat-1",
        "scene_id": "scene-00",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Most people miss the chemistry in JWST images. The mid-infrared band hides a fingerprint that visible light completely erases.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
        "entities": [],
        "required_subject": "",
        "required_entities": [],
        "required_relationships": [],
        "required_actions": [],
        "required_location": "",
        "start_sec": 0.0,
        "end_sec": 7.92,
        "duration_sec": 7.92
      },
      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-2",
        "beat_id": "beat-2",
        "scene_id": "scene-01",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Why does that matter right now? visible light bounces off clouds. Mid-infrared penetrates deeper, hitting the molecular glass of the atmosphere itself.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
        "entities": [],
        "required_subject": "",
        "required_entities": [],
        "required_relationships": [],
        "required_actions": [],
        "required_location": "",
        "start_sec": 7.92,
        "end_sec": 17.09,
        "duration_sec": 9.17
      },
      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-3",
        "beat_id": "beat-3",
        "scene_id": "scene-02",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "From that penetrates, watch what this changes next — the MIRI instrument locks onto carbon dioxide. A sharp spike at five microns confirms the gas is present.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
        "entities": [],
        "required_subject": "",
        "required_entities": [],
        "required_relationships": [],
        "required_actions": [],
        "required_location": "",
        "start_sec": 17.09,
        "end_sec": 28.09,
        "duration_sec": 11.0
      },
      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-4",
        "beat_id": "beat-4",
        "scene_id": "scene-03",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "From that penetrates, but CO2 is just the start. The real question is water vapor, which often gets buried in the thermal noise.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
        "entities": [],
        "required_subject": "",
        "required_entities": [],
        "required_relationships": [],
        "required_actions": [],
        "required_location": "",
        "start_sec": 28.09,
        "end_sec": 37.67,
        "duration_sec": 9.58
      },
      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-5",
        "beat_id": "beat-5",
        "scene_id": "scene-04",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "JWST cools its sensors to near absolute zero. This kills the background heat, letting the water vapor signature shine through. So the takeaway.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
        "entities": [],
        "required_subject": "",
        "required_entities": [],
        "required_relationships": [],
        "required_actions": [],
        "required_location": "",
        "start_sec": 37.67,
        "end_sec": 47.25,
        "duration_sec": 9.58
      }
    ],
